  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是否曾想融入當地居民之中？透過</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Village Masquerade</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，你可以穿著與村民相同的服裝在他們之間閒逛。從農民的沾灰帽子到圖書管理員的精緻長袍，每個職業都有其獨特的風格。這些服裝或許無法抵擋箭矢，但能贏得人心，並在交易時獲得更優惠的價格。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每件裝備都能在你與對應職業的村民交易時提供小幅折扣，穿戴更多件數則能使效果更加顯著。大多數服裝可透過與大師級村民交易獲得。有些套裝較為難尋，會由災厄村民或鐵魔像掉落，而另一些則隱藏在村莊寶箱中。無論你是為了收藏、變裝扮，還是單純想討好你最喜愛的圖書管理員，這模組都能讓每次造訪村莊變得更加有趣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村民服裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿戴靈感來自各種村民職業的服飾。每件裝備都能讓你與對應職業的村民交易時獲得折扣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鎔匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上護目鏡和圍裙，化身為真正的金屬工匠。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🥩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">屠夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">繫上堅固的頭帶和圍裙，準備進行肉類交易。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🗺️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製圖師：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上閃亮的單片眼鏡和皮革束帶，展現帥氣風采。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✝️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神官：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上高領與精緻長袍，適合進行神聖藥水調製。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌾 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">農民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上寬邊帽遮陽，並用腰帶將工具隨身攜帶。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">漁夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上帽子、背心與長褲，隨時準備前往碼頭工作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">箭術師：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上羽毛帽與輕便腰帶，與你的箭矢完美搭配。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👞 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">皮匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上粗獷的圍裙，準備進行皮革鞣製與加工。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圖書管理員：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">裹著柔軟的長袍，戴上整齊的頭飾，專心投入閱讀。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">石匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上沾滿石粉的圍裙，保持整潔俐落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">愚農：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上長袍與長褲，展現慵懶迷人的氣質。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐑 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牧羊人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上羊毛帽與背心，保暖防寒。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚒️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">工具匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">套上工作服圍裙，隨時準備前往鍛造爐。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">武器匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上眼罩與圍裙，展現嚴肅認真的態度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕰️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">經典村民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在村莊戰利品寶箱中尋找復古風格的長袍與長褲。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流浪商人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過交易獲得鮮豔的兜帽、長袍與長褲。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">災厄村民服裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由劫掠者、伏擊者、喚魔師與女巫掉落。穿戴全套可偽裝成他們的一員。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">女巫套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保護你免受負面藥水效果的影響。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鐵魔像套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">稀有掉落物，提供擊退抗性與力量加成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎅 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">秘密聖誕老人套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為節慶季節增添歡樂氣氛的服裝。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> （適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> （適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> （適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援設定，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行配置（需在 Fabric 上安裝由 Prospector 開發的</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需額外安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料夾內，檔名依設定類型分別為</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非所有模組都會包含全部類型的設定檔，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/enderpreston/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">EnderPreston</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發的原始模組 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-employment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Village Employment</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，其素材已重新回歸本模組，並為現代版 Minecraft 進行了優化與翻新。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hang-glider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vehicle-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armored-foes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arcane-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
